# Backend (Go)

Stack: Chi, pgx, JWT, bcrypt, golang-migrate. Modul: `model → repository → service → handler → module`.

## Auth

- Subjects: `admin`, `ishlabchiqaruvchi`, `xaridor`, `dostavka`
- Admin rollar: `general`, `admin`, `kurator`
- Middleware: `auth.Middleware` + `RequireSubject` / `RequireRole`
- Xatoliklar: `httputil.JSON` / `FieldError`, o‘zbekcha `ValidationError`

## Buyurtma

Status: `yangi` → `qabul_qilindi` → `logistikaga_uzatildi` → `yolda` → `yetkazildi_tolov_kutilmoqda` → `yakunlandi`  
Yoki: `fors_major` → `kafolat_bilan_yopildi`

Payment phase: `none` | `awaiting_advance` | `advance_done` | `awaiting_final` | `paid`  
Terms: `prepay_100`, `deferred`, `pod_zakaz_50_50`

## Qoidalar

- Yangi jadval = yangi migratsiya (`migrations/00000N_*.up.sql` + `.down.sql`)
- Router faqat `module.RegisterRoutes`; DI `internal/app/app.go` da
- Upload: `internal/pkg/upload`, max ~5MB; PDF: `modules/order/pdf.go`
- Production CORS domenlari `config.json` da bo‘lishi shart
- `domains` kaliti hozir o‘qilmaydi — CORS/upload ishlatiladi
